        "original_id": "842b2a15-8559-542c-b7d6-fd8a9f6eabf6",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Darwin Airline, Baboo, Aurigny Air Services, LIAT, Deloitte\n- Places: Lugano Airport, Bioggio, Lugano\n- People: Mark Darby\n- Roles: CEO, Head of Aviation Consulting\n- Topics: Airport traffic, airline headquarters, acquisition, bankruptcy\n\nFacts:\n- Lugano Airport handles around 200,000 passengers each year across about 2,400 flights.\n- Darwin Airline has its headquarters at Lugano Airport.\n- Darwin Airline SA is a Swiss regional airline with its head office in Bioggio, Lugano, and it flies under the brand name Adria Airways Switzerland.\n- In November 2010, Darwin Airline Group from Lugano acquired Baboo and saved the company from bankruptcy.\n- Mark Darby previously served as CEO of Baboo and LIAT and as Head of Aviation Consulting at Deloitte.\n- Mark Darby is the CEO of Aurigny Air Services.",
